{"availability":"available","full":"PhyberApex/kuroshiro","name":"kuroshiro","description":"BYOS for TRMNL","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":11,"forks":5,"created":"2025-05-31T19:57:14Z","updated":"2026-10-08T16:03:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://phyberapex.github.io/kuroshiro/","topics":[],"demo":"https://kuroshiro-demo.phyberapex.de/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:20.013Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:20.013Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:20.013Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:58.497Z","stars":11,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:23.051Z","stars":11,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:20.013Z","stars":11,"forks":5}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kuroshiro is an open-source BYOS (Bring Your Own Server) solution for the TRMNL ecosystem. Our goal is to give you more flexibility and control over your TRMNL experience, whether you're self-hosting for fun, learning, or customization. Kuroshiro bundles a NestJS API and a Vue.js UI into a single Docker image, ready to run alongside your own Postgres database.","Take the tour on the showcase site · Try the live demo","Kuroshiro is for anyone who wants to experiment, self-host, and shape their own TRMNL experience:"],"features":["Self-hosted: Your data, your rules, your server.","All-in-one: API (NestJS) + admin UI (Vue 3 + Reka UI) bundled together.","Plug & Play: Just add Postgres and go!","Fun to use: Modern, intuitive, and built for tinkerers and pros alike.","Auto Provisioning: Devices set up themselves—like magic!"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e5cc3f289cf988791c3ad64d862554acad1380230d0b2b8037155465659f633f","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:16:07.768Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:16:07.768Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Kuroshiro is an open-source BYOS (Bring Your Own Server) solution for the TRMNL ecosystem. Our goal is to give you more flexibility and control over your TRMNL experience, whether you're self-hosting for fun, learning, or customization. Kuroshiro bundles a NestJS API and a Vue.js UI into a single Docker image, ready to run alongside your own Postgres database.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Fun to use: Modern, intuitive, and built for tinkerers and pros alike.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Kuroshiro is for anyone who wants to experiment, self-host, and shape their own TRMNL experience:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Kuroshiro isn't the only way to run a TRMNL: the device also works with the official trmnl.com cloud, and with Terminus—the other open-source, self-hosted BYOS.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"If you enable mirroring and provide the MAC and apikey, Kuroshiro fetches the current screen (api/currentscreen) from the official server—mirroring always takes priority.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e5cc3f289cf988791c3ad64d862554acad1380230d0b2b8037155465659f633f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:16:07.769Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T15:42:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:16:07.771Z","hash":"e5cc3f289cf988791c3ad64d862554acad1380230d0b2b8037155465659f633f","originalBytes":30291,"storedBytes":30291,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["device","kuroshiro","data","one","screens","trmnl","official","screen","plugin","api","every","own